INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('RafaellsAlmeida/lifetrek/bmad-agent-cis-storyteller', 'bmad-agent-cis-storyteller', 'RafaellsAlmeida', 'lifetrek', 'community', 'bmad-agent-cis-storyteller RafaellsAlmeida lifetrek community ai automation manufacturing medical react The bmad-agent-cis-storyteller skill provides a medical manufacturing platform with AI-assisted content, operations, and sales workflows, benefiting developers and manufacturers. It utilizes React and AI automation for efficient processes. bmad-agent-cis-storyteller是一个医疗制造平台，具有AI辅助内容、操作和销售工作流程，使用React等技术 bmad-agent-cis-storytellerは、AIエージェントを活用したメディカル製造プラットフォームで、Reactなどの技術を使用しています bmad-agent-cis-storyteller는 AI 에이전트를 활용한 의료 제조 플랫폼으로 React 등의 기술을 사용합니다 bmad-agent-cis-storyteller es una plataforma de manufactura médica con flujos de trabajo asistidos por AI para contenido, operaciones y ventas. Se basa en React para una integración fluida. bmad-agent-cis-storyteller est une plate-forme de fabrication médicale avec des flux de travail assistés par l''IA pour le contenu, les opérations et les ventes. Elle repose sur React pour une intégration fluide. bmad-agent-cis-storyteller ist eine Plattform für die medizinische Fertigung mit AI-gestützten Arbeitsabläufen für Inhalt, Betrieb und Vertrieb. Sie basiert auf React für eine nahtlose Integration. O bmad-agent-cis-storyteller é uma plataforma de manufatura médica com fluxos de trabalho assistidos por IA para conteúdo, operações e vendas, construída com React bmad-agent-cis-storyteller - медицинская производственная платформа с потоками контента, операций и продаж, автоматизированными при помощи ИИ, построенная на основе React العامل bmad-agent-cis-storyteller هو منصة تصنيع طبية مع تدفقات عمل محتوى وتشغيل ومبيعات مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، مبنية باستخدام React how to use bmad-agent-cis-storyteller bmad-agent-cis-storyteller alternative bmad-agent-cis-storyteller setup guide what is bmad-agent-cis-storyteller bmad-agent-cis-storyteller vs competitor bmad-agent-cis-storyteller install medical manufacturing platform AI-assisted content creation React-based manufacturing solutions bmad-agent-cis-storyteller AI工具 医疗制造平台 React 自动化 AI辅助内容 操作和销售工作流程 CLI命令 Loads the full agent file from {project-root}/_bmad/cis/agents/storyteller/storyteller.md for comprehensive configuration Executes all activation steps exactly as written in the agent file for precise setup Follows the agent''s persona and menu system precisely for consistent user experience Utilizes React for building dynamic and interactive user interfaces Employs AI automation for efficient content, operations, and sales workflows Requires strict adherence to activation instructions for optimal performance bmad-agent-cis-storyteller is a medical manufacturing platform that leverages AI-assisted content, operations, and sales workflows for streamlined production and management.');
