thinking vs workflow automation tools","what is bmad-cis-design-thinking","bmad-cis-design-thinking install","bmad-cis-design-thinking tutorial","bmad-cis-design-thinking AI agent integration"],"zh":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","设计思维工作流","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","AI 工具","工作流配置","XML 配置","YAML 配置"],"ja":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","デザイン思考ワークフロー","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","AI エージェント","ワークフローコンフィグ","XML 構成","YAML 構成"],"ko":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","디자인 사고 워크플로우","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","AI 도구","워크플로우 구성","XML 구성","YAML 구성"],"es":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","agentes de ia","pensamiento de diseño","configuración de flujo de trabajo","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","integración con bmad","desarrollo de ia","herramientas de ia"],"fr":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","outils d''ia","pensée de conception","configuration de flux de travail","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","intégration avec bmad","développement d''ia","outils d''ia"],"de":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","ki-tools","design-denken","arbeitsablaufkonfiguration","workflow.xml","workflow.yaml","integration mit bmad","ki-entwicklung","ki-tools"],"pt":["bmad-cis-design-thinking","design thinking","workflow","execução de workflows","ferramentas de design thinking","configuração de workflows","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["ИИ Агент bmad-cis-design-thinking","дизайн-мышление","рабочий процесс","выполнение рабочих процессов","инструменты дизайн-мышления","настройка рабочих процессов","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي bmad-cis-design-thinking","التصميم الإبداعي","سير العمل","تنفيذ سير العمل","أدوات التصميم الإبداعي","إعداد سير العمل","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"ever-sync","repo":"stravox","repoPath":"ever-sync/stravox","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T21:08:00Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bmad-cis-design-thinking","description":"Guide human-centered design processes using empathy-driven methodologies. Use when the user says lets run design thinking or I want to apply design thinking","bodyPreview":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\r\n\r\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\r\n1. Always LOAD the FULL {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\r\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml\r\n3. Pass the yaml path _bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml as ''workflow-config'' parameter to the workflow.xm","body":"IT IS CRITICAL THAT YOU FOLLOW THESE STEPS - while staying in character as the current agent persona you may have loaded:\r\n\r\n<steps CRITICAL=\"TRUE\">\r\n1. Always LOAD the FULL {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml\r\n2. READ its entire contents - this is the CORE OS for EXECUTING the specific workflow-config {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml\r\n3. Pass the yaml path _bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml as ''workflow-config'' parameter to the workflow.xml instructions\r\n4. Follow workflow.xml instructions EXACTLY as written to process and follow the specific workflow config and its instructions\r\n5. Save outputs after EACH section when generating any documents from templates\r\n</steps>\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:18:50.046Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Workflow Agents requiring advanced configuration management via workflow.xml and workflow.yaml files.","zh":"适用于需要通过workflow.xml和workflow.yaml文件进行高级配置管理的AI Workflow Agents。","ja":"ワークフローxmlとワークフローyamlファイルを介した高度な設定管理を必要とするAIワークフローエージェントに適しています。","ko":"workflow.xml 및 workflow.yaml 파일을 통해 고급 구성 관리가 필요한 AI 워크플로 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de flujo de trabajo de IA que requieren una gestión de configuración avanzada a través de archivos workflow.xml y workflow.yaml.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de workflow d''IA nécessitant une gestion de configuration avancée via des fichiers workflow.xml et workflow.yaml.","de":"Ideal für AI-Workflow-Agents, die eine erweiterte Konfigurationsverwaltung über workflow.xml- und workflow.yaml-Dateien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho de IA que exigem gerenciamento de configuração avançado via arquivos workflow.xml e workflow.yaml.","ru":"Идеально для агентов рабочего процесса ИИ, требующих расширенного управления конфигурациями через файлы workflow.xml и workflow.yaml.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تدفق عمل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يتطلب إدارة تكوين متقدمة من خلال ملفات workflow.xml و workflow.yaml."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute specific workflows by loading and reading workflow.xml and workflow.yaml files, providing a critical core OS for executing design-thinking workflow configurations using workflow.yaml files, and seamlessly integrating with workflow.xml parameters.","zh":"赋予代理执行特定工作流的能力，通过加载和读取workflow.xml和workflow.yaml文件，提供一个用于执行设计思维工作流配置的关键核心OS，使用workflow.yaml文件，并与workflow.xml参数无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに特定のワークフローを実行する能力を付与し、ワークフローxmlとワークフローyamlファイルをロードして読み取り、設計思考ワークフローの構成を実行するための重要なコアOSを提供し、ワークフローyamlファイルを使用してワークフローxmlパラメータとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 특정 워크플ロー를 실행할 수 있도록 하며, workflow.xml 및 workflow.yaml 파일을 로드하고 읽어들이고, 디자인思考 워크플로 구성을 실행하는 데 중요한 코어 OS를 제공하며, workflow.yaml 파일을 사용하여 workflow.xml 매개 변수와 무결점으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar flujos de trabajo específicos cargando y leyendo archivos workflow.xml y workflow.yaml, proporcionando un núcleo de sistema operativo crítico para ejecutar configuraciones de flujos de trabajo de diseño de pensamiento utilizando archivos workflow.yaml, e integrándose de forma transparente con parámetros de workflow.xml.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des flux de travail spécifiques en chargeant et en lisant des fichiers workflow.xml et workflow.yaml, en fournissant un noyau de système d''exploitation critique pour exécuter des configurations de flux de travail de conception réflexive en utilisant des fichiers workflow.yaml, et en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec des paramètres de workflow.xml.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, bestimmte Workflows durch Laden und Lesen von workflow.xml- und workflow.yaml-Dateien auszuführen, wodurch ein kritischer Systemkern für die Ausführung von Design-Thinking-Workflow-Konfigurationen unter Verwendung von workflow.yaml-Dateien bereitgestellt wird und nahtlos in workflow.xml-Parameter integriert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho específicos carregando e lendo arquivos workflow.xml e workflow.yaml, fornecendo um núcleo de sistema operacional crítico para executar configurações de fluxo de trabalho de pensamento de design usando arquivos workflow.yaml e integrando-se perfeitamente com parâmetros workflow.xml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять конкретные рабочие процессы, загружая и читая файлы workflow.xml и workflow.yaml, обеспечивая критически важное ядро операционной системы для выполнения конфигураций рабочего процесса дизайн-мышления с помощью файлов workflow.yaml и бесшовно интегрируясь с параметрами workflow.xml.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تشغيل عمليات معينة من خلال تحميل و قراءة ملفات workflow.xml و workflow.yaml، و تقديم نظام تشغيل أساسي حاسم لتشغيل تكوينات تدفق عمل لفكر التصميم باستخدام ملفات workflow.yaml و التكامل السلس مع معلمات workflow.xml."},"useCases":{"en":["Loading and executing workflow configurations from workflow.xml files","Reading and parsing workflow.yaml files for design-thinking workflows","Passing workflow-config parameters to workflow.xml for seamless execution"],"zh":["从workflow.xml文件加载和执行工作流配置","读取和解析workflow.yaml文件以进行设计思维工作流","将工作流配置参数传递给workflow.xml以实现无缝执行"],"ja":["ワークフローxmlファイルからワークフロー構成をロードして実行する","設計思考ワークフロー用のワークフローyamlファイルを読み取って解析する","ワークフロー構成パラメータをワークフローxmlに渡してシームレスに実行する"],"ko":["workflow.xml 파일에서 워크플로 구성을 로드하고 실행하는 것","디자인思考 워크플로를 위한 workflow.yaml 파일을 읽고 해석하는 것","워크플로 구성을 워크플로 xml에 전달하여 무결점으로 실행하는 것"],"es":["Cargar y ejecutar configuraciones de flujo de trabajo desde archivos workflow.xml","Leer y analizar archivos workflow.yaml para flujos de trabajo de diseño de pensamiento","Pasar parámetros de configuración de flujo de trabajo a workflow.xml para una ejecución transparente"],"fr":["Charger et exécuter des configurations de flux de travail à partir de fichiers workflow.xml","Lire et analyser des fichiers workflow.yaml pour des flux de travail de conception réflexive","Passer des paramètres de configuration de flux de travail à workflow.xml pour une exécution transparente"],"de":["Laden und Ausführen von Workflow-Konfigurationen aus workflow.xml-Dateien","Lesen und Parsen von workflow.yaml-Dateien für Design-Thinking-Workflows","Übergeben von Workflow-Konfigurationsparametern an workflow.xml für eine nahtlose Ausführung"],"pt":["Carregar e executar configurações de fluxo de trabalho de arquivos workflow.xml","Ler e analisar arquivos workflow.yaml para fluxos de trabalho de pensamento de design","Passar parâmetros de configuração de fluxo de trabalho para workflow.xml para execução sem interrupção"],"ru":["Загрузка и выполнение конфигураций рабочего процесса из файлов workflow.xml","Чтение и разбор файлов workflow.yaml для рабочих процессов дизайн-мышления","Передача параметров конфигурации рабочего процесса в workflow.xml для бесперебойного выполнения"],"ar":["تحميل و تشغيل تكوينات تدفق عمل من ملفات workflow.xml","قراءة و تحليل ملفات workflow.yaml لتدفقات عمل فكر التصميم","نقل معلمات تكوين تدفق العمل إلى workflow.xml للتشغيل السلس"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml and {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml files","Mandatory to follow specific steps for loading and reading workflow files"],"zh":["需要访问{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml和{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml文件","加载和读取工作流文件时必须遵循特定的步骤"],"ja":["{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xmlと{project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yamlファイルへのアクセスが必要","ワークフローファイルをロードして読み取る際に特定の手順に従うことが必須"],"ko":["{project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml 및 {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml 파일에 접근할 수 있어야 함","워크플로 파일을 로드하고 읽을 때 특정 단계를 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml y {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","Es obligatorio seguir pasos específicos para cargar y leer archivos de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml et {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","Il est obligatoire de suivre des étapes spécifiques pour charger et lire des fichiers de flux de travail"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dateien {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml und {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","Es ist obligatorisch, bestimmte Schritte für das Laden und Lesen von Workflow-Dateien zu befolgen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml e {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","Obrigatório seguir etapas específicas para carregar e ler arquivos de fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml и {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","Обязательно следовать конкретным шагам для загрузки и чтения файлов рабочего процесса"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملفات {project-root}/_bmad/core/tasks/workflow.xml و {project-root}/_bmad/cis/workflows/design-thinking/workflow.yaml","يجب اتباع خطوات محددة لتحميل و قراءة ملفات تدفق العمل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"c6e428b9ccd21661d9b539f723469faaba21d3a742240ad031fa82f6f7dcb64e","qualityScore":26}');
