ativos web","Otimização do desempenho da aplicação"],"ru":["Реактивные связи для Cookie Store API","Улучшение опыта разработки","Интеграция с API хранилища файлов cookie","Поддержка разработчиков веб-приложений","Оптимизация производительности приложения"],"ar":["ربط تفاعلي لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات Cookie Store","تحسين تجربة التطوير","التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تخزين الكعكات","دعم مطورين تطبيقات الويب","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["vitest AIエージェント","Cookie Store API","反应绑定","如何使用vitest","vitest安装","vitest设置指南","vitest替代品","vitest和其他工具的比较"],"ja":["vitest AIエージェント","Cookie Store API","リアクティブバインディング","vitestの使い方","vitestのインストール","vitestの設定ガイド","vitestの代替","vitestと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["vitest AI 에이전트","Cookie Store API","반응형 바인딩","vitest 사용 방법","vitest 설치","vitest 설정 가이드","vitest 대체품","vitest와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI","vitest","enlaces reactivos","Cookie Store API","desarrollo eficiente","guía de instalación de vitest","alternativas a vitest","vitest vs otras herramientas","cómo usar vitest","qué es vitest"],"fr":["outils IA","vitest","liens réactifs","API Cookie Store","développement efficace","guide d''installation de vitest","alternatives à vitest","vitest vs autres outils","comment utiliser vitest","qu''est-ce que vitest"],"de":["KI-Tools","vitest","reaktive Bindungen","Cookie Store API","effizientes Entwicklung","Installationsanleitung für vitest","Alternativen zu vitest","vitest vs andere Tools","wie man vitest verwendet","was ist vitest"],"pt":["como usar vitest","o que é vitest","vitest alternative","vitest vs jest","instalar vitest","guia de configuração do vitest","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web com vitest"],"ru":["как использовать vitest","что такое vitest","альтернативы vitest","vitest vs jest","установка vitest","руководство по настройке vitest","разработка веб-приложений с vitest"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام vitest","ما هو vitest","بديل vitest","vitest مقابل jest","تثبيت vitest","دليل إعداد vitest","تطوير تطبيقات الويب باستخدام vitest"]}},"owner":"junwen-k","repo":"cookie-store","repoPath":"junwen-k/cookie-store","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.284Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vitest","description":"Vitest fast unit testing framework powered by Vite with Jest-compatible API. Use when writing tests, mocking, configuring coverage, or working with test filtering and fixtures.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeS","body":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeScript, JSX support without configuration\n- Multi-threaded workers for parallel test execution\n- Built-in coverage via V8 or Istanbul\n- Snapshot testing, mocking, and spy utilities\n\n> The skill is based on Vitest 3.x, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | Vitest and Vite config integration, defineConfig usage | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| CLI | Command line interface, commands and options | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md) |\n| Test API | test/it function, modifiers like skip, only, concurrent | [core-test-api](references/core-test-api.md) |\n| Describe API | describe/suite for grouping tests and nested suites | [core-describe](references/core-describe.md) |\n| Expect API | Assertions with toBe, toEqual, matchers and asymmetric matchers | [core-expect](references/core-expect.md) |\n| Hooks | beforeEach, afterEach, beforeAll, afterAll, aroundEach | [core-hooks](references/core-hooks.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Mocking | Mock functions, modules, timers, dates with vi utilities | [features-mocking](references/features-mocking.md) |\n| Snapshots | Snapshot testing with toMatchSnapshot and inline snapshots | [features-snapshots](references/features-snapshots.md) |\n| Coverage | Code coverage with V8 or Istanbul providers | [features-coverage](references/features-coverage.md) |\n| Test Context | Test fixtures, context.expect, test.extend for custom fixtures | [features-context](references/features-context.md) |\n| Concurrency | Concurrent tests, parallel execution, sharding | [features-concurrency](references/features-concurrency.md) |\n| Filtering | Filter tests by name, file patterns, tags | [features-filtering](references/features-filtering.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Vi Utilities | vi helper: mock, spyOn, fake timers, hoisted, waitFor | [advanced-vi](references/advanced-vi.md) |\n| Environments | Test environments: node, jsdom, happy-dom, custom | [advanced-environments](references/advanced-environments.md) |\n| Type Testing | Type-level testing with expectTypeOf and assertType | [advanced-type-testing](references/advanced-type-testing.md) |\n| Projects | Multi-project workspaces, different configs per project | [advanced-projects](references/advanced-projects.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:25:34.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing fast and efficient test updates with Vite-native support and Jest-compatible API.","zh":"非常适合需要快速高效测试更新的JavaScript测试代理，支持Vite原生和Jest兼容API。","ja":"ViteネイティブサポートとJest互換APIを持つ高速で効率的なテスト更新が必要なJavaScriptテストエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Vite 네이티브 지원과 Jest 호환 API를 갖춘 빠르고 효율적인 테스트 업데이트가 필요한 JavaScript 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de prueba de JavaScript que necesitan actualizaciones de prueba rápidas y eficientes con soporte nativo de Vite y API compatible con Jest.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test JavaScript nécessitant des mises à jour de test rapides et efficaces avec un support natif Vite et une API compatible Jest.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Testagenten, die schnelle und effiziente Testaktualisierungen mit nativer Vite-Unterstützung und Jest-kompatibler API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Teste JavaScript que precisam de atualizações de teste rápidas e eficientes com suporte nativo Vite e API compatível com Jest.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов тестирования JavaScript, которым необходимы быстрые и эффективные обновления тестов с родной поддержкой Vite и API, совместимой с Jest.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء اختبار JavaScript الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات اختبار سريعة وفعالة مع دعم Vite الأصلي وواجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع Jest."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates, utilizing native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support, while seamlessly integrating with Vite apps through shared config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins.","zh":"赋予代理利用Vite的转换管道进行快速HMR样式测试更新，使用原生ESM、TypeScript和JSX支持，同时通过共享配置、转换器、解析器和插件无缝集成到Vite应用中。","ja":"Viteの変換パイプラインを利用して高速なHMRスタイルのテスト更新を可能にすることで、エージェントに力を与え、ネイティブESM、TypeScript、JSXのサポートを利用し、共有コンフィグ、トランスフォーマー、リゾルバ、プラグインを介してViteアプリケーションにシームレスに統合します。","ko":"Vite의 변환 파이프라인을 사용하여 빠른 HMR 스타일 테스트 업데이트 기능을 제공함으로써 에이전트에 힘을 부여하고, 네이티브 ESM, TypeScript, JSX 지원을 사용하며, 공유 구성, 트랜스포머, 리졸버 및 플러그인을 통해 Vite 애플리케이션과 무缝하게 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la canalización de transformación de Vite para actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas similares a HMR, utilizando soporte nativo ESM, TypeScript y JSX, mientras se integra de forma transparente con aplicaciones Vite a través de una configuración compartida, transformadores, resolutores y plugins.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter la canalisation de transformation de Vite pour des mises à jour de test rapides similaires à HMR, en utilisant un support natif ESM, TypeScript et JSX, tout en s''intégrant de manière transparente aux applications Vite via une configuration partagée, des transformateurs, des résolveurs et des plugins.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Vites Transformation-Pipeline für schnelle HMR-ähnliche Testaktualisierungen zu nutzen, wobei native ESM-, TypeScript- und JSX-Unterstützung verwendet wird, während sie sich nahtlos in Vite-Apps über eine gemeinsame Konfiguration, Transformer, Resolver und Plugins integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o pipeline de transformação do Vite para atualizações de teste rápidas semelhantes ao HMR, utilizando suporte nativo ESM, TypeScript e JSX, enquanto se integra perfeitamente com aplicativos Vite por meio de configuração compartilhada, transformadores, resolvedores e plug-ins.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать конвейер трансформации Vite для быстрых обновлений тестов, подобных HMR, используя родную поддержку ESM, TypeScript и JSX, а также обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с приложениями Vite посредством общей конфигурации, трансформеров, решателей и плагинов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الاستفادة من трубة التحويل الخاصة بـ Vite من أجل تحديثات اختبار سريعة تشبه HMR، واستخدام دعم ESM الأصلي و TypeScript و JSX، وتكاملها بشكل متجانس مع تطبيقات Vite من خلال تكوين مشترك و متحولات و محددات و إضافات."},"useCases":{"en":["Rapidly testing Vite applications with smart watch mode","Migrating existing Jest test suites to Vitest for improved performance","Utilizing Vitest''s native ESM support for efficient module graph analysis"],"zh":["使用智能监视模式快速测试Vite应用","将现有的Jest测试套件迁移到Vitest以提高性能","利用Vitest的原生ESM支持进行高效模块图分析"],"ja":["スマートウォッチモードを使用してViteアプリケーションを迅速にテストする","既存のJestテストスイートをVitestに移行してパフォーマンスを向上させる","VitestのネイティブESMサポートを使用して効率的なモジュールグラフ分析を実行する"],"ko":["스마트 워치 모드를 사용하여 Vite 애플리케이션을 빠르게 테스트하는 것","기존 Jest 테스트 스위트를 Vitest로 마이그레이션하여 성능을 개선하는 것","Vitest의 네이티브 ESM 지원을 사용하여 효율적인 모듈 그래프 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Pruebas rápidas de aplicaciones Vite con modo de reloj inteligente","Migración de suites de pruebas de Jest existentes a Vitest para un mejor rendimiento","Uso del soporte ESM nativo de Vitest para un análisis eficiente del grafo de módulos"],"fr":["Test rapide d''applications Vite avec mode de montre intelligente","Migration de suites de test Jest existantes vers Vitest pour une meilleure performance","Utilisation du support ESM natif de Vitest pour une analyse efficace du graphique de modules"],"de":["Schnelles Testen von Vite-Anwendungen mit intelligentem Watch-Modus","Migration bestehender Jest-Test-Suiten zu Vitest für verbesserte Leistung","Verwendung der nativen ESM-Unterstützung von Vitest für eine effiziente Modul-Graph-Analyse"],"pt":["Testar rapidamente aplicações Vite com modo de relógio inteligente","Migrar conjuntos de testes Jest existentes para Vitest para melhorar o desempenho","Utilizar o suporte ESM nativo do Vitest para análise gráfica de módulos eficiente"],"ru":["Быстрое тестирование приложений Vite в режиме умного хронометража","Миграция существующих наборов тестов Jest в Vitest для улучшения производительности","Использование родной поддержки ESM в Vitest для эффективного анализа графа модулей"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات Vite بسرعة مع وضع الساعة الذكي","نقل مجموعات اختبار Jest الحالية إلى Vitest لتحسين الأداء","استخدام دعم ESM الأصلي من Vitest للتحليل الفعال لرسومية الوحدات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite configuration and setup","Limited to JavaScript and TypeScript projects","Compatibility issues may arise with non-Vite or non-Jest test suites"],"zh":["需要Vite配置和设置","仅限于JavaScript和TypeScript项目","可能会与非Vite或非Jest测试套件出现兼容性问题"],"ja":["Viteの設定とセットアップが必要","JavaScriptとTypeScriptのプロジェクトのみに対応","Vite以外またはJest以外のテストスイートと互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["Vite 구성 및 설정이 필요","JavaScript 및 TypeScript 프로젝트만 해당","Vite 이외 또는 Jest 이외의 테스트 스위트와 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de Vite","Limitado a proyectos de JavaScript y TypeScript","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con suites de pruebas no Vite o no Jest"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration et une installation de Vite","Limité aux projets JavaScript et TypeScript","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec des suites de test non Vite ou non Jest"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-Konfiguration und -Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und TypeScript-Projekte","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können mit nicht-Vite- oder nicht-Jest-Test-Suiten auftreten"],"pt":["Exige configuração e instalação do Vite","Limitado a projetos JavaScript e TypeScript","Pode surgir problemas de compatibilidade com conjuntos de testes não Vite ou não Jest"],"ru":["Требует настройки и установки Vite","Ограничен проектами JavaScript и TypeScript","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости с наборами тестов, не являющимися Vite или Jest"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين Vite وضبطه","محدود بمشاريع JavaScript و TypeScript","قد تنشأ проблемы في التوافق مع مجموعات الاختبار غير Vite أو غير Jest"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"87c8cf025987d1f1a0e9c0fd0b8605946a0ebd5478676471ce296d8f0adc0f07","qualityScore":26}');
