实施 및 최적화","AI 에이전트의 가격 분석 및 예측"],"es":["Análisis de precios en tiempo real","Optimización de precios mediante algoritmos de IA","Integración con plataformas de comercio electrónico","Informes y análisis de datos de precios","Personalización de estrategias de precios"],"fr":["Analyse de prix en temps réel","Optimisation de prix via des algorithmes d''IA","Intégration avec des plateformes de commerce électronique","Rapports et analyses de données de prix","Personnalisation de stratégies de prix"],"de":["Echtzeit-Preisanalyse","Preisoptimierung durch KI-Algorithmen","Integration mit E-Commerce-Plattformen","Berichte und Datenanalyse von Preisen","Anpassung von Preisstrategien"],"pt":["Criação de estratégias de preços personalizadas","Análise de dados de mercado com ferramentas de IA","Otimização de preços para melhorar a conversão","Integração com aplicativos Android como diary by tag","Suporte a múltiplos canais de venda"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальной системы ценообразования","Анализ рыночных данных с помощью ИИ Агентов","Оптимизация цен для улучшения конверсии","Интеграция с Android-приложениями, такими как diary by tag","Поддержка нескольких каналов продаж"],"ar":["إنشاء استراتيجيات تسعير مخصصة","تحليل بيانات السوق باستخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأسعار لتحسين التحويل","التكامل مع التطبيقات الأندرويد مثل diary by tag","دعم قنوات بيع متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント定价策略","Android应用diary by tag 価格优化","提高应用盈利能力","价格战略实施","AIエージェント价格分析","如何使用AIエージェント","AIエージェント的优点"],"ja":["AIエージェントの価格戦略","Androidアプリdiary by tag 価格最適化","アプリの収益を増やす","価格戦略の実施","AIエージェントの価格分析","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트의 가격 전략","Android 애플리케이션 diary by tag 가격 최적화","애플리케이션의 수익을 높이는 방법","가격 전략의实施","AI 에이전트의 가격 분석","AI 에이전트의 사용 방법","AI 에이전트의 장점"],"es":["herramientas de estrategia de precios","cómo usar herramientas de IA","qué es la estrategia de precios","alternativas a las herramientas de estrategia de precios","cómo instalar herramientas de estrategia de precios","guía de configuración de herramientas de estrategia de precios"],"fr":["outils de stratégie de prix","comment utiliser les outils d''IA","quoi est la stratégie de prix","alternatives aux outils de stratégie de prix","comment installer les outils de stratégie de prix","guide de configuration des outils de stratégie de prix"],"de":["Preisstrategie-Tools","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist Preisstrategie","Alternativen zu Preisstrategie-Tools","wie man Preisstrategie-Tools installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für Preisstrategie-Tools"],"pt":["como criar estratégia de preços","ferramentas de IA para preços","diary by tag android","otimização de preços","estratégia de preços para aplicativos","preços personalizados","análise de dados de mercado"],"ru":["как разработать систему ценообразования","ИИ Агенты для ценообразования","diary by tag android","оптимизация цен","система ценообразования для приложений","индивидуальные цены","анализ рыночных данных"],"ar":["كيفية إنشاء استراتيجية تسعير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتسعير","diary by tag أندرويد","تحسين الأسعار","استراتيجية التسعير للتطبيقات","أسعار مخصصة","تحليل بيانات السوق"]}},"owner":"ksrae","repo":"tag-diary-app","repoPath":"ksrae/tag-diary-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T02:54:09Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pricing-strategy","description":"When the user wants help with pricing decisions, packaging, or monetization strategy. Also use when the user mentions pricing, pricing tiers, freemium, free trial, packaging, price increase, value metric, Van Westendorp, willingness to pay, or monetization. This skill covers pricing research, tier structure, and packaging strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Busines","body":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Context\n- What type of product? (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service)\n- What''s your current pricing (if any)?\n- What''s your target market? (SMB, mid-market, enterprise)\n- What''s your go-to-market motion? (self-serve, sales-led, hybrid)\n\n### 2. Value & Competition\n- What''s the primary value you deliver?\n- What alternatives do customers consider?\n- How do competitors price?\n\n### 3. Current Performance\n- What''s your current conversion rate?\n- What''s your ARPU and churn rate?\n- Any feedback on pricing from customers/prospects?\n\n### 4. Goals\n- Optimizing for growth, revenue, or profitability?\n- Moving upmarket or expanding downmarket?\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Fundamentals\n\n### The Three Pricing Axes\n\n**1. Packaging** — What''s included at each tier?\n- Features, limits, support level\n- How tiers differ from each other\n\n**2. Pricing Metric** — What do you charge for?\n- Per user, per usage, flat fee\n- How price scales with value\n\n**3. Price Point** — How much do you charge?\n- The actual dollar amounts\n- Perceived value vs. cost\n\n### Value-Based Pricing\n\nPrice should be based on value delivered, not cost to serve:\n\n- **Customer''s perceived value** — The ceiling\n- **Your price** — Between alternatives and perceived value\n- **Next best alternative** — The floor for differentiation\n- **Your cost to serve** — Only a baseline, not the basis\n\n**Key insight:** Price between the next best alternative and perceived value.\n\n---\n\n## Value Metrics\n\n### What is a Value Metric?\n\nThe value metric is what you charge for—it should scale with the value customers receive.\n\n**Good value metrics:**\n- Align price with value delivered\n- Are easy to understand\n- Scale as customer grows\n- Are hard to game\n\n### Common Value Metrics\n\n| Metric | Best For | Example |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| Per user/seat | Collaboration tools | Slack, Notion |\n| Per usage | Variable consumption | AWS, Twilio |\n| Per feature | Modular products | HubSpot add-ons |\n| Per contact/record | CRM, email tools | Mailchimp |\n| Per transaction | Payments, marketplaces | Stripe |\n| Flat fee | Simple products | Basecamp |\n\n### Choosing Your Value Metric\n\nAsk: \"As a customer uses more of [metric], do they get more value?\"\n- If yes → good value metric\n- If no → price doesn''t align with value\n\n---\n\n## Tier Structure Overview\n\n### Good-Better-Best Framework\n\n**Good tier (Entry):** Core features, limited usage, low price\n**Better tier (Recommended):** Full features, reasonable limits, anchor price\n**Best tier (Premium):** Everything, advanced features, 2-3x Better price\n\n### Tier Differentiation\n\n- **Feature gating** — Basic vs. advanced features\n- **Usage limits** — Same features, different limits\n- **Support level** — Email → Priority → Dedicated\n- **Access** — API, SSO, custom branding\n\n**For detailed tier structures and persona-based packaging**: See [references/tier-structure.md](references/tier-structure.md)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Research\n\n### Van Westendorp Method\n\nFour questions that identify acceptable price range:\n1. Too expensive (wouldn''t consider)\n2. Too cheap (question quality)\n3. Expensive but might consider\n4. A bargain\n\nAnalyze intersections to find optimal pricing zone.\n\n### MaxDiff Analysis\n\nIdentifies which features customers value most:\n- Show sets of features\n- Ask: Most important? Least important?\n- Results inform tier packaging\n\n**For detailed research methods**: See [references/research-methods.md](references/research-methods.md)\n\n---\n\n## When to Raise Prices\n\n### Signs It''s Time\n\n**Market signals:**\n- Competitors have raised prices\n- Prospects don''t flinch at price\n- \"It''s so cheap!\" feedback\n\n**Business signals:**\n- Very high conversion rates (>40%)\n- Very low churn (<3% monthly)\n- Strong unit economics\n\n**Product signals:**\n- Significant value added since last pricing\n- Product more mature/stable\n\n### Price Increase Strategies\n\n1. **Grandfather existing** — New price for new customers only\n2. **Delayed increase** — Announce 3-6 months out\n3. **Tied to value** — Raise price but add features\n4. **Plan restructure** — Change plans entirely\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Page Best Practices\n\n### Above the Fold\n- Clear tier comparison table\n- Recommended tier highlighted\n- Monthly/annual toggle\n- Primary CTA for each tier\n\n### Common Elements\n- Feature comparison table\n- Who each tier is for\n- FAQ section\n- Annual discount callout (17-20%)\n- Money-back guarantee\n- Customer logos/trust signals\n\n### Pricing Psychology\n- **Anchoring:** Show higher-priced option first\n- **Decoy effect:** Middle tier should be best value\n- **Charm pricing:** $49 vs. $50 (for value-focused)\n- **Round pricing:** $50 vs. $49 (for premium)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Checklist\n\n### Before Setting Prices\n- [ ] Defined target customer personas\n- [ ] Researched competitor pricing\n- [ ] Identified your value metric\n- [ ] Conducted willingness-to-pay research\n- [ ] Mapped features to tiers\n\n### Pricing Structure\n- [ ] Chosen number of tiers\n- [ ] Differentiated tiers clearly\n- [ ] Set price points based on research\n- [ ] Created annual discount strategy\n- [ ] Planned enterprise/custom tier\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pricing research have you done?\n2. What''s your current ARPU and conversion rate?\n3. What''s your primary value metric?\n4. Who are your main pricing personas?\n5. Are you self-serve, sales-led, or hybrid?\n6. What pricing changes are you considering?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pricing page conversion\n- **copywriting**: For pricing page copy\n- **marketing-psychology**: For pricing psychology principles\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing pricing changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:12:51.836Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SaaS-focused AI Agents needing advanced pricing strategy optimization and monetization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级定价策略优化和盈利能力的SaaS焦点AI代理","ja":"SaaSに焦点を当てた高度な価格戦略の最適化と収益化の機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 가격 전략 최적화 및 수익 창출 기능이 필요한 SaaS 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA centrados en SaaS que necesitan una optimización de estrategia de precios avanzada y capacidades de monetización.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS nécessitant une optimisation de stratégie de tarification avancée et des capacités de monétisation.","de":"Perfekt für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Preisstrategie-Optimierung und Monetisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em SaaS que necessitam de otimização avançada de estratégia de preços e capacidades de monetização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на SaaS, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация стратегии ценообразования и возможностей монетизации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يركزون على السحابة وهم بحاجة إلى تحسين استراتيجية التسعير وتقنيات التحرك المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture value, drive growth, and align pricing with customer willingness to pay using comprehensive content analysis and product marketing context, leveraging files like `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` and understanding of SaaS pricing and monetization strategy.","zh":"赋予代理商捕获价值、驱动增长和将定价与客户愿意支付的价格对齐的能力，使用全面内容分析和产品营销背景，利用诸如`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`的文件和对SaaS定价和盈利策略的理解","ja":"エージェントに価値を把握し、成長を促進し、価格を顧客が支払う価値と一致させる能力を与え、包括的なコンテンツ分析と製品マーケティングコンテキストを使用し、`.claude/product-marketing-context.md`のようなファイルとSaaSの価格と収益化戦略の理解を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 가치를 포착하고 성장률을 높이고 가격을 고객이 지불할 의사가 있는 가격과 일치시키는 기능을 부여하여 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 제품 마케팅 컨텍스트를 사용하고 `.claude/product-marketing-context.md`와 같은 파일 및 SaaS 가격 및 수익화 전략에 대한 이해를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar valor, impulsar el crecimiento y alinear los precios con la voluntad del cliente de pagar utilizando un análisis de contenido integral y el contexto de marketing de productos, aprovechando archivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` y comprensión de la estrategia de precios y monetización de SaaS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capter la valeur, de stimuler la croissance et d''aligner les tarifs sur la volonté du client de payer en utilisant une analyse de contenu complète et le contexte de marketing de produits, en exploitant des fichiers tels que `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` et en comprenant la stratégie de tarification et de monétisation SaaS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Wert zu erfassen, Wachstum zu fördern und Preise mit der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden in Einklang zu bringen, indem sie eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und den Produktmarketing-Kontext unter Einsatz von Dateien wie `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` und unter Berücksichtigung der SaaS-Preis- und Monetisierungsstrategie nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar valor, impulsionar o crescimento e alinhar os preços com a disposição do cliente para pagar, utilizando análise de conteúdo abrangente e contexto de marketing de produtos, aproveitando arquivos como `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` e compreensão da estratégia de preços e monetização do SaaS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить ценность, стимулировать рост и согласовать цены с готовностью клиента платить, используя всесторонний анализ контента и контекст продукта маркетинга, используя файлы типа `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` и понимание стратегии ценообразования и монетизации SaaS.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من التقاط القيمة وتحفيز النمو وتنظيم التسعير مع استعداد العملاء للدفع، باستخدام تحليل محتوى شاملة وسياق تسويق المنتج، والاستفادة من الملفات مثل `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` وفهم استراتيجية التسعير وتحريك السحابة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing pricing models that maximize revenue","Analyzing customer willingness to pay for SaaS products","Developing monetization strategies for SaaS businesses"],"zh":["设计能够最大化收入的定价模型","分析客户愿意为SaaS产品支付的价格","为SaaS企业开发盈利策略"],"ja":["収益を最大化する価格モデルを設計する","SaaS製品に対する顧客の支払い意欲を分析する","SaaSビジネスに対する収益化戦略を開発する"],"ko":["수익을 최대화하는 가격 모델을 설계","SaaS 제품에 대한 고객의 지불 의지를 분석","SaaS 비즈니스에 대한 수익화 전략을 개발"],"es":["Diseñar modelos de precios que maximicen los ingresos","Analizar la voluntad del cliente de pagar por productos SaaS","Desarrollar estrategias de monetización para empresas SaaS"],"fr":["Concevoir des modèles de tarification qui maximisent les revenus","Analyser la volonté du client de payer pour les produits SaaS","Développer des stratégies de monétisation pour les entreprises SaaS"],"de":["Preismodelle entwerfen, die den Umsatz maximieren","Die Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden für SaaS-Produkte analysieren","Monetisierungsstrategien für SaaS-Unternehmen entwickeln"],"pt":["Projetar modelos de preços que maximizam a receita","Analisar a disposição do cliente para pagar por produtos SaaS","Desenvolver estratégias de monetização para empresas SaaS"],"ru":["Проектировать модели ценообразования, которые максимизируют доход","Анализировать готовность клиента платить за продукты SaaS","Разрабатывать стратегии монетизации для бизнеса SaaS"],"ar":["تصميم نماذج تسعيرية تزيد الإيرادات","تحليل استعداد العملاء لدفع ثمن منتجات السحابة","تطوير استراتيجيات تحريك لشركات ا