La configuration de développement de Pedro EDR est le processus de setup du référentiel pour les développeurs, qui inclut la configuration de la branche et la mise à jour des sous-modules Git","de":"Die Einrichtung von Pedro EDR für Entwickler ist der Prozess der Konfiguration des Repositorys, der die Konfiguration des Branchs und die Aktualisierung von Git-Submodulen umfasst","pt":"O setup [dev] é uma ferramenta de configuração para o Pet EDR Operation.","ru":"Настройка setup [dev] - это инструмент для конфигурации Pet EDR Operation.","ar":"إعداد setup [dev] هو أداة إعداد لتشغيل Pet EDR Operation"},"features":{"en":["Switches to the right branch and performs a git pull --rebase","Ensures git submodules are checked out with git submodule update --init --recursive","Verifies vendor/abseil-cpp checkout","Supports development on the dev branch","Runs tests to validate the repository setup","Uses git commands for repository management"],"zh":["支持切换到正确的分支（dev或master）","自动更新git子模块","使用git pull --rebase确保代码更新","支持vendor/abseil-cp等第三方库","提供快速入门的设置流程"],"ja":["正しいブランチ（devまたはmaster）への切り替えをサポート","gitサブモジュールの自動更新","git pull --rebaseを使用してコードを更新","vendor/abseil-cpなどのサードパーティライブラリをサポート","快速入門の設定プロセスを提供"],"ko":["브랜치 전환 지원（dev 또는 master）","Git 서브모듈 자동 업데이트","Git pull --rebase를 사용하여 코드 업데이트","vendor/abseil-cpなどの 제3자 라이브러리를 지원","快速入門 설정 프로세스 제공"],"es":["Configuración de la rama de desarrollo","Actualización de submódulos de Git","Ejecución de tests para verificar la configuración","Uso de Git pull --rebase para actualizar el repositorio","Verificación de la configuración del proyecto"],"fr":["Configuration de la branche de développement","Mise à jour des sous-modules Git","Exécution de tests pour vérifier la configuration","Utilisation de Git pull --rebase pour mettre à jour le référentiel","Vérification de la configuration du projet"],"de":["Konfiguration des Entwicklungszweigs","Aktualisierung von Git-Submodulen","Ausführung von Tests zur Überprüfung der Konfiguration","Verwendung von Git pull --rebase zur Aktualisierung des Repositorys","Überprüfung der ProjektKonfiguration"],"pt":["Suporte ao branch dev","Integração com git submodule","Verificação de dependências com vendor/abseil-cp","Execução de git pull --rebase","Configuração do repositório Pet EDR Operation"],"ru":["Поддержка ветки dev","Интеграция с git submodule","Проверка зависимостей с vendor/abseil-cp","Выполнение git pull --rebase","Настройка репозитория Pet EDR Operation"],"ar":["دعم فرع التطوير dev","التكامل مع git submodule","تحقق من التبعيات مع vendor/abseil-cp","تشغيل git pull --rebase","إعداد مخزن Pet EDR Operation"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use setup [dev]","setup [dev] install guide","Pedro repository setup","git submodule update","git pull --rebase","setup [dev] vs other EDRs","Linux EDR setup","setup [dev] alternative"],"zh":["setup [dev]","Pedro仓库","git子模块","git pull --rebase","vendor/abseil-cp","快速入门","AI工具","设置指南"],"ja":["setup [dev]","Pedroリポジトリ","gitサブモジュール","git pull --rebase","vendor/abseil-cp","快速入門","AIエージェント","設定ガイド"],"ko":["setup [dev]","Pedro 리포지토리","Git 서브모듈","Git pull --rebase","vendor/abseil-cp","快速入門","AI 에이전트","설정 가이드"],"es":["configuración de desarrollo","pedro edr","herramienta de detección y respuesta","linux","desarrollo de software","git","submódulos","tests","setup de desarrollo"],"fr":["configuration de développement","pedro edr","outil de détection et de réponse","linux","développement de logiciels","git","sous-modules","tests","setup de développement"],"de":["Einrichtung von Entwicklern","pedro edr","Endgeräte-Erkennungs- und -Reaktions-Tool","linux","Software-Entwicklung","git","Submodule","Tests","Setup für Entwickler"],"pt":["setup dev","Pet EDR Operation","ferramenta de código aberto","configuração de linux","git submodule","vendor/abseil-cp","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["настройка setup dev","Pet EDR Operation","легковесный ИИ Агент","конфигурация linux","git submodule","vendor/abseil-cp","разработчики","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إعداد setup dev","Pet EDR Operation","أداة مفتوحة المصدر","إعداد لINUX","git submodule","vendor/abseil-cp","المطورين","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"wowsignal-io","repo":"pedro","repoPath":"wowsignal-io/pedro","stars":18,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T20:08:55Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"setup [dev]","description":"First-time repo setup — submodules, dependencies, and verification","bodyPreview":"# First-Time Repo Setup\n\nSet up the Pedro repository from a fresh clone so it builds and passes all tests.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Switch to the right branch and do a pull**\n\n   If the user passed `dev` as argument, the switch to the `dev` branch before doing anything.\n   Otherwise switch to `master`. In both cases, run a `git pull --rebase`.\n\n2. **Ensure git submodules are checked out**\n\n   Run `git submodule update --init --recursive` from the project root.\n   Verify by checking that `vendor/abseil-cp","body":"# First-Time Repo Setup\n\nSet up the Pedro repository from a fresh clone so it builds and passes all tests.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Switch to the right branch and do a pull**\n\n   If the user passed `dev` as argument, the switch to the `dev` branch before doing anything.\n   Otherwise switch to `master`. In both cases, run a `git pull --rebase`.\n\n2. **Ensure git submodules are checked out**\n\n   Run `git submodule update --init --recursive` from the project root.\n   Verify by checking that `vendor/abseil-cpp` and `vendor/libbpf` are non-empty.\n\n3. **Run full setup**\n\n   Run `./scripts/setup.sh -a` to install all build, test, and dev dependencies.\n   This takes a while — capture output to a temp file. It''s normal for this step to take up to 30+ minutes.\n   Check the output for errors. If setup reports a needed reboot (grub/kernel config changes),\n   inform the user and stop.\n\n4. **Run quick tests**\n\n   Invoke `/quicktest` (no arguments) to run unit tests and verify the build works.\n   If tests fail, investigate and report — don''t proceed to presubmit until unit tests pass.\n\n5. **Run presubmit**\n\n   Invoke `/presubmit` to run the full presubmit suite (includes e2e tests, formatting, linting).\n   If failures occur, investigate and report to the user.\n\n6. **Report results**\n\n   Summarize what was done and the final state:\n   - Submodule status\n   - Setup completion\n   - Test results (unit + presubmit)\n   - Any issues that need user attention (e.g. reboot required, flaky tests)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:42:02.391Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined repository setup and testing for open-source EDR on Linux.","zh":"非常适合需要简化仓库设置和在 Linux 上测试开源 EDR 的开发代理。","ja":"Linux 上のオープンソース EDR のテストとリポジトリの設定を簡素化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"리눅스에서 오픈소스 EDR를 테스트하고 저장소 설정을 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una configuración de repositorio simplificada y pruebas para EDR de código abierto en Linux.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une configuration de référentiel simplifiée et de tests pour EDR open-source sur Linux.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine vereinfachte Repository-Konfiguration und Tests für Open-Source-EDR unter Linux benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de configuração de repositório simplificada e testes para EDR de código aberto no Linux.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется упрощенная настройка репозитория и тестирование для открытого EDR в Linux.","ar":"مثالي لوفاء تطوير بحاجة إلى إعداد مخزن مبسط واختبارات لمفتوح المصدر EDR على نظام التشغيل Linux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate git repository setup, ensuring a smooth build and test process by utilizing git submodules and branch management, including git pull --rebase and git submodule update --init --recursive.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化 git 仓库设置的能力，通过利用 git 子模块和分支管理（包括 git pull --rebase 和 git submodule update --init --recursive），确保构建和测试过程顺畅进行。","ja":"git サブモジュールとブランチ管理（git pull --rebase と git submodule update --init --recursive を含む）を利用して、git リポジトリの設定を自動化するエージェントを可能にし、ビルドとテストのプロセスをスムーズにします。","ko":"git 서브모듈과 브랜치 관리(git pull --rebase와 git submodule update --init --recursive)를 활용하여 git 저장소 설정을 자동화하고 빌드 및 테스트 프로세스를 원활하게 진행할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la configuración del repositorio git, asegurando un proceso de compilación y prueba sin problemas mediante el uso de submódulos git y gestión de ramas, incluyendo git pull --rebase y git submodule update --init --recursive.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la configuration du référentiel git, garantissant un processus de construction et de test fluide en utilisant des sous-modules git et une gestion de branches, y compris git pull --rebase et git submodule update --init --recursive.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die git-Repository-Konfiguration zu automatisieren, wodurch ein reibungsloser Build- und Testprozess durch die Verwendung von git-Submodulen und Branch-Management sichergestellt wird, einschließlich git pull --rebase und git submodule update --init --recursive.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a configuração do repositório git, garantindo um processo de compilação e teste suave utilizando submódulos git e gerenciamento de branch, incluindo git pull --rebase e git submodule update --init --recursive.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать настройку репозитория git, обеспечивая гладкий процесс сборки и тестирования с использованием подмодулей git и управления ветками, включая git pull --rebase и git submodule update --init --recursive.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تلقين إعداد مستودع git، مما يضمن عملية بناء واختبار سلسة باستخدام مكونات فرعية git وإدارة الفرع، بما في ذلك git pull --rebase و git submodule update --init --recursive."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating first-time repository setup","Switching between dev and master branches","Initializing git submodules for dependencies like vendor/abseil-cpp"],"zh":["自动化首次仓库设置","在开发和主分支之间切换","初始化 git 子模块以用于依赖项如 vendor/abseil-cpp"],"ja":["初回リポジトリ設定の自動化","dev ブランチと master ブランチの切り替え","依存関係として vendor/abseil-cpp を使用する git サブモジュールの初期化"],"ko":["초기 저장소 설정 자동화","개발 및 마스터 브랜치 사이의 전환","의존성으로 vendor/abseil-cpp를 사용하는 git 서브모듈 초기화"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración del repositorio por primera vez","Cambiar entre las ramas dev y master","Inicializar submódulos git para dependencias como vendor/abseil-cpp"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration du référentiel pour la première fois","Basculer entre les branches dev et master","Initialiser les sous-modules git pour les dépendances comme vendor/abseil-cpp"],"de":["Automatisieren der Repository-Konfiguration zum ersten Mal","Wechseln zwischen den Zweigen dev und master","Initialisieren von git-Submodulen für Abhängigkeiten wie vendor/abseil-cpp"],"pt":["Automatizar a configuração do repositório pela primeira vez","Alternar entre branches dev e master","Inicializar submódulos git para dependências como vendor/abseil-cpp"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку репозитория в первый раз","Переключаться между ветками dev и master","Инициализировать подмодули git для зависимостей, таких как vendor/abseil-cpp"],"ar":["تلقين إعداد المستودع لأول مرة","التبديل بين الفروع dev و master","تهيئة مكونات فرعية git للاعتماديات مثل vendor/abseil-cpp"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation","Linux environment only","Specific to Pedro repository setup"],"zh":["需要 git 安装","仅限 Linux 环境","特定于 Pedro 仓库设置"],"ja":["git のインストールが必要","Linux 環境のみ","Pedro リポジトリ設定に特有"],"ko":["git 설치가 필요함","리눅스 환경만 지원","Pedro 저장소 설정에 특정"],"es":["Requiere instalación de git","Entorno de Linux solo","Específico de la configuración del repositorio Pedro"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git","Environnement Linux uniquement","Spécifique à la configuration du référentiel Pedro"],"de":["Benötigt git-Installation","Nur Linux-Umgebung","Spezifisch für die Pedro-Repository-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer instalação do git","Ambiente Linux apenas","Específico para configuração do repositório Pedro"],"ru":["Требуется установка git","Только среда Linux","Конкретно для настройки репозитория Pedro"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت git","بيئة لينكس فقط","محدد لإعداد مستودع Pedro"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"605bb3bca5377340a2e142358b809d00889096da11d089d8df7174ada68c5608","qualityScore":23}');
